    {
      "id": "E9",
      "key": "reverse",
      "name": {
        "zh": "左右反向",
        "en": "mirror left/right"
      },
      "desc": {
        "zh": "[0 正常／1 左右反向]：感應器反裝時用，通道順序與線位置左右對調；校準值照實體通道存，切換不用重校；存 RAM，重開機回 0（舊 mBlock 沒有）；SPIKE 參數超出範圍回失敗（狀態 2）",
        "en": "[0 normal / 1 mirrored]: for a sensor mounted backwards — channel order and line position are mirrored; calibration stays per physical channel; RAM only, 0 after reset (not in legacy mBlock); on SPIKE an out-of-range value returns failed (state 2)"
      },
      "params": [
        {
